{
  "$comment": [
    "Orca allows at most 512 mappings per icon theme; Symbols has about 1,500.",
    "build.mjs keeps mappings in this order until the budget runs out:",
    "1. the generic file and folder icons;",
    "2. `essentials` below, in the order written;",
    "3. one name per remaining Symbols icon, so every icon still shows somewhere;",
    "4. the remaining names, a round at a time across all icons.",
    "`languageExtensions` and `languageFileNames` stand in for VS Code language ids, which Orca does not have.",
    "Each lists the names VS Code gives a language id; build.mjs adds only names Symbols does not already map."
  ],
